# Admin screen catalog

When you **add, remove, or rename** a user-facing page under the homeowner dashboard, contractor portal, or `/review` flow:

1. Update `lib/admin/screen-catalog.ts` (one entry per page, not per tab).
2. Add fixtures and a preview case in `components/admin/preview/admin-preview-screen.tsx` when the page should appear in the admin iframe gallery.
3. Run `npm run check:screen-catalog` and fix any reported gaps before finishing.

Do **not** catalog: `design-system/`, marketing (`/homeowners`, `/contractors`), auth, admin, or redirect-only routes.

At the end of the task, if a new `page.tsx` was created in scope above, remind the project owner whether the catalog was updated or still needs preview/fixture work.

See `docs/ADMIN_SCREEN_CATALOG.md` for the full checklist.
